mp4?t=1761755501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262950/extras/3c279605e2e52efcfb345b7251a7b42a.avif?t=1761755501\" width=365 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is important to maintain communication with your coworkers, during meals every worker gathers at the cafeteria of the Gunshop to eat and socialize.</p>",
